Some parts of Retro Nim UI come from others under their own licenses: the
fonts, the icons, the map's country outlines, uirelays, SQLite, Monocypher,
and the Android headers the APK tool carries. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md lists
each one, where its license text is, and what an app that ships it needs to
do.
